    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the robot to find the shortest path through the portals and destroy the bomb.\u00a0<br><br>The rules are simple: you  pick up the bomb and throw it into the bomb disposer. <br>But every step you make with the bomb is drains you energy. To get the bomb disposer you'll have to take a shortcut. And that's where the portals will help you. You just need to decide which portals to use.<br>\u00a0<br>The game features 70+ hand-drawn puzzles that designed to make you think outside the box and have various unique game mechanics. And, of course, plenty of portals.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the robot to find the shortest path through the portals and destroy the bomb.\u00a0<br><br>The rules are simple: you  pick up the bomb and throw it into the bomb disposer. <br>But every step you make with the bomb is drains you energy. To get the bomb disposer you'll have to take a shortcut. And that's where the portals will help you. You just need to decide which portals to use.<br>\u00a0<br>The game features 70+ hand-drawn puzzles that designed to make you think outside the box and have various unique game mechanics. And, of course, plenty of portals.</p>",
    "short_description": "Portal way is a puzzle game where you need to find the shortest way through the portals.",
